{
  "slug": "open-rx",
  "name": "Open Rx",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Open RX makes Claude actually good at building production web apps. 7 free skills (OTC tier) covering React architecture, Next.js App Router patterns, performance optimization, prompt engineering, UX copywriting, local SEO, and the rx-writer consultation system. Every skill is packed with real patterns from real codebases — not generic boilerplate. Upgrade to The Prescription ($1) for 17 skills and 27+ reference files covering UI components, animations, SaaS patterns, database ops, API design, testing, deployment, security, conversion optimization, and brand design.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **24 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (24): `api-craft` (Production-grade API design and backend patterns for modern web applications), `brand-builder` (Premium skill for building complete brand identity and design systems for web applications), `build` (Universal compound skill for operational chaos in trades and project-based businesses), `chain` (Sales pipeline and lead generation compound), `claudezempic` (AI workflow audit and optimization compound), `conversion-ops` (Comprehensive conversion optimization, analytics, and growth engineering patterns for modern web apps), `copy-craft` (UX copy, marketing copy, microcopy, headlines, CTAs, error messages, empty states, onboarding flows, email copy, and landing page…), `database-ops` (Production-grade database operations and schema design for Supabase/PostgreSQL), and 16 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install open-rx@claude-community` from `CutTheChexx/open-rx`.",
